      "releaseNotes": "What’s New in Version 3.6.0\n\n• Added a disclaimer in the iOS instructions for refresh intervals under 30 seconds\n• Added an in-app disclaimer in the extension when using refresh intervals under 30 seconds\n• Improved reliability and recovery for sub-30-second refresh timers\n• Increased the minimum supported iOS version to 16.6\n\nThis update improves clarity around shorter refresh intervals and makes timer behavior more stable overall.",
