      "description": "Simple Refresh brings automatic webpage refresh functionality to Safari on iOS and macOS.\nStop manually refreshing pages—let Simple Refresh do it for you.\n\nWith an intuitive slider interface or direct input, set your preferred refresh interval from\n1 second to 10 minutes and let the extension handle the rest. Each Safari tab maintains its\nown refresh settings, so you can monitor multiple pages simultaneously with different refresh\nrates.\n\nKey Features:\n- Automatic page refresh at customizable intervals (1s, 5s, 15s, 30s, 1m, 2m, 5m, 10m, or any\ncustom interval between 1s and 10m)\n- Live countdown timer shows time remaining until next refresh\n- Slider control or click-to-edit display for flexible input\n- Independent refresh settings for each tab\n- Visual \"On\" badge shows active refresh status\n- Settings persist across browser sessions\n- Efficient battery usage with smart refresh engine\n- Available in 27 languages\n- Works on both iPhone, iPad, and Mac\n\nPerfect for:\n- Monitoring live scores, stock tickers, and weather updates\n- Watching for content changes without manual refreshing\n- Development and testing workflows\n- Any webpage that updates frequently\n\nSimple Refresh focuses on doing one thing well: refreshing webpages automatically. No complex\nsetup, no unnecessary features—just reliable, automatic refresh when you need it.",
